xref:starts_with[The text ``t`` starts with ``t~prefix~``]

. Check that the length of ``t~prefix~`` is less than or equal to the length of ``t``.

. Check that ``t[0 : the length of t~prefix~]`` is equal to ``t~prefix~``.
 return ``true``.

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``false``.

xref:ends_with[The text ``t`` ends with ``t~suffix~``]

. Check that the length of ``t~suffix~`` is less than or equal to the length of ``t``.

. Let ``n~start~`` be the length of ``t`` - the length of ``t~suffix~``.
. Check that ``t[n~start~ : the length of t~suffix~]`` is equal to ``t~suffix~``.
 return ``true``.

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``false``.

xref:strip_prefix_rec[The text ``t`` with the prefix ``t~prefix~`` removed many times as possible]

. If xref:starts_with[the text ``t`` starts with ``t~prefix~``]:
 .. Let ``t~stripped~`` be xref:strip_prefix[the text ``t`` with the prefix ``t~prefix~`` removed].
 .. Return xref:strip_prefix_rec[the text ``t~stripped~`` with the prefix ``t~prefix~`` removed many times as possible].
. Else:
 .. Return ``t``.

xref:strip_suffix_rec[The text ``t`` with the suffix ``t~suffix~`` removed many times as possible]

. If xref:ends_with[the text ``t`` ends with ``t~suffix~``]:
 .. Let ``t~stripped~`` be xref:strip_suffix[the text ``t`` with the suffix ``t~suffix~`` removed].
 .. Return xref:strip_suffix_rec[the text ``t~stripped~`` with the suffix ``t~suffix~`` removed many times as possible].
. Else:
 .. Return ``t``.

xref:contains[The text ``t`` contains ``t~c~``]

. Return ``xref:contains'[$contains'(0, the length of t, t, t~c~)]``.

xref:contains'[$contains'(n~len''~, n~len'''~, t, t~c~)]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``n~len''~`` is equal to ``n~len'''~``.
 return ``false``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``n~len''~`` is less than ``n~len'''~``.

  ... If ``t[n~len''~]`` is equal to ``t~c~``: return ``true``.
  ... Else:
   .... Return ``xref:contains'[$contains'(n~len''~ + 1, n~len'''~, t, t~c~)]``.

