xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[The expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace''``]

. If let ``literalExpression`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. Return ``literalExpression``.
. Else if let ``referenceExpression`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. Return ``referenceExpression``.
. Else if let ``unaryExpression`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. Return ``unaryExpression``.
. Else if let ``expressionNonBrace~l~ binop expression~r~`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. Let ``expression~l~`` be xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace~l~``].
 .. Return ``expression~l~ binop expression~r~``.
. Else if let ``expressionNonBrace~cond~ +?+ expression~true~ +:+ expression~false~`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. Let ``expression~cond~`` be xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace~cond~``].
 .. Return ``expression~cond~ +?+ expression~true~ +:+ expression~false~``.
. Else if let ``castExpression`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. Return ``castExpression``.
. Else if let ``errorAccessExpression`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. Return ``errorAccessExpression``.
. Else if let ``memberAccessBaseNonBrace +.+ member`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. If let ``prefixedTypeName`` be ``memberAccessBaseNonBrace``:
  ... Return ``prefixedTypeName +.+ member``.
 .. Else:
  ... Let ``expression~base~`` be xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace~base~``].
  ... Return ``expression~base~ +.+ member``.
. Else if let ``expressionNonBrace~base~ +[+expression~index~+]+`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. Let ``expression~base~`` be xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace~base~``].
 .. Return ``expression~base~ +[+expression~index~+]+``.
. Else if let ``sliceAccessExpressionNonBrace`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. If let ``expressionNonBrace~base~ +[+expression~hi~ +:+ expression~lo~+]+`` be ``sliceAccessExpressionNonBrace``:
  ... Let ``expression~base~`` be xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace~base~``].
  ... Return ``expression~base~ +[+expression~hi~ +:+ expression~lo~+]+``.
 .. Else:
  ... Let ``expression~base~`` be xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace~base~``].
  ... Return ``expression~base~ +[+expression~l~ +++ +:+ expression~w~+]+``.
. Else if let ``callExpressionNonBrace`` be ``expressionNonBrace''``:
 .. If let ``callTargetNonBrace +(+argumentList+)+`` be ``callExpressionNonBrace``:
  ... If let ``expressionNonBrace`` be ``callTargetNonBrace``:
   .... Let ``expression`` be xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace``].
   .... Return ``expression +(+argumentList+)+``.
  ... Else:
   .... Return ``constructorTarget +(+argumentList+)+``.
 .. Else:
  ... Let ``expression`` be xref:expressionNonBrace_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``expressionNonBrace``].
  ... Return ``expression +<+realTypeArgumentList+>+ +(+argumentList+)+``.
. Else:
 .. Return ``parenthesizedExpression``.

