  ... Else if let ``lvalue~base~ +[+expression~hi~ +++ +:+ expression~lo~+]+`` be ``lvalue''``:
   .... Let ``expression~base~`` be xref:lvalue_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``lvalue~base~``].
   .... Return ``expression~base~ +[+expression~hi~ +++ +:+ expression~lo~+]+``.
  ... Else if let ``+(+lvalue+)+`` be ``lvalue''``:
   .... Let ``expression`` be xref:lvalue_as_expression[the expression corresponding to ``lvalue``].
   .... Return ``+(+expression+)+``.

xref:expression_as_lvalue[The l-value corresponding to ``expression''``]

. If let ``referenceExpression`` be ``expression''``:
 .. Return ``referenceExpression``.
. Else if let ``memberAccessBase +.+ member`` be ``expression''``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``expression`` be ``memberAccessBase``.

 .. Let ``lvalue`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:expression_as_lvalue[the l-value corresponding to ``expression``].
 .. Return ``lvalue +.+ member``.
. Else if let ``expression~base~ +[+expression~index~+]+`` be ``expression''``:
 .. Let ``lvalue~base~`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:expression_as_lvalue[the l-value corresponding to ``expression~base~``].
 .. Return ``lvalue~base~ +[+expression~index~+]+``.
. Else if let ``sliceAccessExpression`` be ``expression''``:
 .. If let ``expression~base~ +[+expression~hi~ +:+ expression~lo~+]+`` be ``sliceAccessExpression``:
  ... Let ``lvalue~base~`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:expression_as_lvalue[the l-value corresponding to ``expression~base~``].
  ... Return ``lvalue~base~ +[+expression~hi~ +:+ expression~lo~+]+``.
 .. Else:
  ... Let ``lvalue~base~`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:expression_as_lvalue[the l-value corresponding to ``expression~base~``].
  ... Return ``lvalue~base~ +[+expression~hi~ +++ +:+ expression~lo~+]+``.
. Else if let ``+(+expression+)+`` be ``expression''``:
 .. Let ``lvalue`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:expression_as_lvalue[the l-value corresponding to ``expression``].
 .. Return ``+(+lvalue+)+``.

xref:assignop_as_binop[The binary operator corresponding to ``assignop``]

. If ``assignop`` matches pattern ``++=+``:
 .. Return ``+++``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+-=+``:
 .. Return ``+-+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+|+|=+``:
 .. Return ``+|+|+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+|-|=+``:
 .. Return ``+|-|+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+*=+``:
 .. Return ``+*+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+/=+``:
 .. Return ``+/+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+%=+``:
 .. Return ``+%+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+<<=+``:
 .. Return ``+<<+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+>>=+``:
 .. Return ``+>>+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+&=+``:
 .. Return ``+&+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+^=+``:
 .. Return ``+^+``.
. Else:
 .. Return ``+|+``.

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``·``.

