xref:write_value_from_bits[$write_value_from_bits(value, n~var~, b^{asterisk}^)]

. Let ``( value~updated~, bool^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:write_value_from_bits'[$write_value_from_bits'(value, n~var~, b^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Check that ``bool^{asterisk}^`` is an empty list.

. Return ``value~updated~``.

xref:write_value_from_bits'[$write_value_from_bits'(value'', n~var'~, bool'^{asterisk}^)]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If let ``++_++`` be ``value''``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``b~h~ {two-colons} b~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``bool'^{asterisk}^``.

   .... Return ( ``b~h~``, ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` ).
  ... Else if let ``integerLiteral`` be ``value''``:
   .... If let ``w +W+ ++_++`` be ``integerLiteral``:
    ..... Check that the length of ``bool'^{asterisk}^`` is greater than or equal to ``w``.

    ..... Let ``b~h~^{asterisk}^`` be ``bool'^{asterisk}^[0 : w]``.
    ..... Let ``n~t~`` be the length of ``bool'^{asterisk}^`` - ``w``.
    ..... Let ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``bool'^{asterisk}^[w : n~t~]``.
    ..... Let ``i`` be xref:int_to_bitstr[the bitstring of width ``w`` representing the integer ``$bits_to_int_unsigned(b~h~^{asterisk}^)``].
    ..... Return ( ``w +W+ i``, ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` ).
   .... Else if let ``w +S+ ++_++`` be ``integerLiteral``:
    ..... Check that the length of ``bool'^{asterisk}^`` is greater than or equal to ``w``.

    ..... Let ``b~h~^{asterisk}^`` be ``bool'^{asterisk}^[0 : w]``.
    ..... Let ``n~t~`` be the length of ``bool'^{asterisk}^`` - ``w``.
    ..... Let ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``bool'^{asterisk}^[w : n~t~]``.
    ..... Let ``i`` be xref:int_to_bitstr[the bitstring of width ``w`` representing the integer ``$bits_to_int_signed(b~h~^{asterisk}^)``].
    ..... Return ( ``w +S+ i``, ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` ).
  ... Else if let ``+STRUCT+ typeId +{+fieldValue^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value''``:
   .... Let ``( fieldValue~updated~^{asterisk}^, b~rest~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:write_value_fields_from_bits'[$write_value_fields_from_bits'(fieldValue^{asterisk}^, n~var'~, bool'^{asterisk}^)]``.
   .... Return ( ``+STRUCT+ typeId +{+fieldValue~updated~^{asterisk}^+}+``, ``b~rest~^{asterisk}^`` ).
  ... Else if let ``+HEADER+ typeId +{+++_++ +;+ fieldValue^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value''``:
   .... Let ``( fieldValue~updated~^{asterisk}^, b~rest~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:write_value_fields_from_bits'[$write_value_fields_from_bits'(fieldValue^{asterisk}^, n~var'~, bool'^{asterisk}^)]``.
   .... Return ( ``+HEADER+ typeId +{+true +;+ fieldValue~updated~^{asterisk}^+}+``, ``b~rest~^{asterisk}^`` ).
  ... Else if let ``enumValue`` be ``value''``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``typeId +.+ nameIR +.+ value`` be ``enumValue``.

   .... Let ``( value~updated~, b~rest~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:write_value_from_bits'[$write_value_from_bits'(value, n~var'~, bool'^{asterisk}^)]``.
   .... Return ( ``typeId +.+ "__UNSPECIFIED" +.+ value~updated~``, ``b~rest~^{asterisk}^`` ).
  ... Else if let ``+HEADER_STACK+ +[+value^{asterisk}^ +(+n~idx~ +;+ n~size~+)++]+`` be ``value''``:
   .... Let ``( value~updated~^{asterisk}^, b~rest~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:write_values_from_bits'[$write_values_from_bits'(value^{asterisk}^, n~var'~, bool'^{asterisk}^)]``.
   .... Return ( ``+HEADER_STACK+ +[+value~updated~^{asterisk}^ +(+n~idx~ +;+ n~size~+)++]+``, ``b~rest~^{asterisk}^`` ).
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``integerValue`` be ``value''``.

  ... Let!~type~ ``n~max~ +.+ ++_++ +V+ i`` be ``integerValue``.

  ... Try:
   .... {empty}
    ..... Check that ``n~var'~`` is equal to ``0``.

    ..... Return ( ``n~max~ +.+ 0 +V+ i``, ``bool'^{asterisk}^`` ).
   .... {empty}
    ..... Check that the length of ``bool'^{asterisk}^`` is greater than or equal to ``n~var'~``.

    ..... Let ``b~h~^{asterisk}^`` be ``bool'^{asterisk}^[0 : n~var'~]``.
    ..... Let ``n~t~`` be the length of ``bool'^{asterisk}^`` - ``n~var'~``.
    ..... Let ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``bool'^{asterisk}^[n~var'~ : n~t~]``.
    ..... Let ``i`` be xref:int_to_bitstr[the bitstring of width ``n~var'~`` representing the integer ``$bits_to_int_signed(b~h~^{asterisk}^)``].
    ..... Return ( ``n~max~ +.+ n~var'~ +V+ i``, ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` ).

xref:write_values_from_bits'[$write_values_from_bits'(value^{asterisk}^, n~var~, b^{asterisk}^)]

. If ``value^{asterisk}^`` matches pattern ``[]``:
 .. Return ( ``·``, ``b^{asterisk}^`` ).
. Else:
 .. Let ``( value~h_updated~, b~t~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:write_value_from_bits'[$write_value_from_bits'(value~h~, n~var~, b^{asterisk}^)]``.
 .. Let ``( value~t_updated~^{asterisk}^, b~rest~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:write_values_from_bits'[$write_values_from_bits'(value~t~^{asterisk}^, n~var~, b~t~^{asterisk}^)]``.
