 .. Let ``( fieldValue~t_updated~^{asterisk}^, b~rest~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:write_value_fields_from_bits'[$write_value_fields_from_bits'(fieldValue~t~^{asterisk}^, n~var~, b~t~^{asterisk}^)]``.
 .. Return ( ``fieldValue~h_updated~ {two-colons} fieldValue~t_updated~^{asterisk}^``, ``b~rest~^{asterisk}^`` ).

