xref:write_bits_from_value[$write_bits_from_value(value'')]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If let ``b`` be ``value''``:
   .... Return ``b``.
  ... Else if let ``integerLiteral`` be ``value''``:
   .... If let ``w +S+ i`` be ``integerLiteral``:
    ..... Return ``xref:int_to_bits_signed[$int_to_bits_signed(w, i)]``.
   .... Else if let ``w +W+ i`` be ``integerLiteral``:
    ..... Return ``xref:int_to_bits_unsigned[$int_to_bits_unsigned(w, i)]``.
  ... Else if let ``+HEADER_STACK+ +[+value~element~^{asterisk}^ +(+++_++ +;+ ++_+++)++]+`` be ``value''``:
   .... Return ``xref:concat_[$concat_<bool>($write_bits_from_value(value~element~)^{asterisk}^)]``.
  ... Else if let ``+STRUCT+ ++_++ +{+( value~field~ id~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value''``:
   .... Return ``xref:concat_[$concat_<bool>($write_bits_from_value(value~field~)^{asterisk}^)]``.
  ... Else if let ``+HEADER+ ++_++ +{+bool +;+ ( value~field~ id~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value''``:
   .... Check that ``bool`` is equal to ``true``.

   .... Return ``xref:concat_[$concat_<bool>($write_bits_from_value(value~field~)^{asterisk}^)]``.
   .... Let ``+HEADER+ ++_++ +{+bool +;+ ++_++^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value''``.
   .... Check that ``bool`` is equal to ``false``.

   .... Return ``·``.
  ... Else if let ``+HEADER_UNION+ ++_++ +{+( value id +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value''``:
   .... Return ``xref:concat_[$concat_<bool>($write_bits_from_value(value)^{asterisk}^)]``.
  ... Else if let ``enumValue`` be ``value''``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``typeId +.+ id +.+ value`` be ``enumValue``.

   .... Return ``xref:write_bits_from_value[$write_bits_from_value(value)]``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``integerValue`` be ``value''``.

  ... Let!~type~ ``++_++ +.+ w +V+ i`` be ``integerValue``.

  ... Return ``xref:int_to_bits_unsigned[$int_to_bits_unsigned(w, i)]``.

