xref:bin_eq[``value`` ``+==+`` ``value'``]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If let ``b~a~`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``b~b~`` be ``value'``.

   .... Return ``b~a~`` is equal to ``b~b~``.
  ... Else if let ``+ERROR+ +.+ id~a~`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``+ERROR+ +.+ id~b~`` be ``value'``.

   .... Return ``id~a~`` is equal to ``id~b~``.
  ... Else if let ``+MATCH_KIND+ +.+ id~a~`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``+MATCH_KIND+ +.+ id~b~`` be ``value'``.

   .... Return ``id~a~`` is equal to ``id~b~``.
  ... Else if let ``stringValue~a~`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``stringValue~b~`` be ``value'``.

   .... Return ``stringValue~a~`` is equal to ``stringValue~b~``.
  ... Else if let ``integerLiteral`` be ``value``:
   .... If let ``+D+ i~a~`` be ``integerLiteral``:
    ..... Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral'`` be ``value'``.

    ..... Let!~type~ ``+D+ i~b~`` be ``integerLiteral'``.

    ..... Return ``i~a~`` is equal to ``i~b~``.
   .... Else if let ``w~a~ +W+ i~a~`` be ``integerLiteral``:
    ..... Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral'`` be ``value'``.

    ..... Let!~type~ ``w~b~ +W+ i~b~`` be ``integerLiteral'``.

    ..... Return ``w~a~`` is equal to ``w~b~`` and ``i~a~`` is equal to ``i~b~``.
   .... Else:
    ..... Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral'`` be ``value'``.

    ..... Let!~type~ ``w~b~ +S+ i~b~`` be ``integerLiteral'``.

    ..... Return ``w~a~`` is equal to ``w~b~`` and ``i~a~`` is equal to ``i~b~``.
  ... Else if let ``+LIST+ +[+value~a~^{asterisk}^+]+`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``+LIST+ +[+value~b~^{asterisk}^+]+`` be ``value'``.

   .... Return the length of ``value~a~^{asterisk}^`` is equal to the length of ``value~b~^{asterisk}^`` and xref:forall_[all ``( $bin_eq(value~a~, value~b~) )^{asterisk}^`` are true].
  ... Else if let ``+TUPLE+ +(+value~a~^{asterisk}^+)+`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``+TUPLE+ +(+value~b~^{asterisk}^+)+`` be ``value'``.

   .... Return the length of ``value~a~^{asterisk}^`` is equal to the length of ``value~b~^{asterisk}^`` and xref:forall_[all ``( $bin_eq(value~a~, value~b~) )^{asterisk}^`` are true].
  ... Else if let ``+HEADER_STACK+ +[+value~a~^{asterisk}^ +(+++_++ +;+ n~size_a~+)++]+`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``+HEADER_STACK+ +[+value~b~^{asterisk}^ +(+++_++ +;+ n~size_b~+)++]+`` be ``value'``.

   .... Return the length of ``value~a~^{asterisk}^`` is equal to the length of ``value~b~^{asterisk}^`` and xref:forall_[all ``( $bin_eq(value~a~, value~b~) )^{asterisk}^`` are true] and ``n~size_a~`` is equal to ``n~size_b~``.
  ... Else if let ``+STRUCT+ typeId~a~ +{+fieldValue~a~^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``+STRUCT+ typeId~b~ +{+fieldValue~b~^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value'``.

   .... Let ``value~field_a~ nameIR~field_a~ +;+`` be ``fieldValue~a~``, for all ``fieldValue~a~`` in ``fieldValue~a~^{asterisk}^``, ``nameIR~field_a~`` in ``nameIR~field_a~^{asterisk}^``, and ``value~field_a~`` in ``value~field_a~^{asterisk}^``.
   .... Let ``value~field_b~ nameIR~field_b~ +;+`` be ``fieldValue~b~``, for all ``fieldValue~b~`` in ``fieldValue~b~^{asterisk}^``, ``nameIR~field_b~`` in ``nameIR~field_b~^{asterisk}^``, and ``value~field_b~`` in ``value~field_b~^{asterisk}^``.
   .... Return ``typeId~a~`` is equal to ``typeId~b~`` and the length of ``fieldValue~a~^{asterisk}^`` is equal to the length of ``fieldValue~b~^{asterisk}^`` and xref:forall_[all ``( $bin_eq(value~field_a~, value~field_b~) )^{asterisk}^`` are true] and xref:forall_[all ``( nameIR~field_a~ = nameIR~field_b~ )^{asterisk}^`` are true].
  ... Else if let ``+HEADER+ typeId~a~ +{+++_++ +;+ fieldValue~a~^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value``:
   .... Let!~type~ ``+HEADER+ typeId~b~ +{+++_++ +;+ fieldValue~b~^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``value'``.

