   .... Check that ``invalidHeaderValue`` matches pattern ``+{#}+``.

   .... Let!~type~ ``invalidHeaderValue'`` be ``value'``.

   .... Check that ``invalidHeaderValue'`` matches pattern ``+{#}+``.
 return ``true``.
