xref:cast_set[``setValue`` casted to type ``typeIR'``]

. Let!~type~ ``+SET+ +<+typeIR+>+`` be ``typeIR'``.

. If let ``+SET+ +{+value+}+`` be ``setValue``:
 .. Return ``+SET+ +{+xref:cast_op[$cast_op(typeIR, value)]+}+``.
. Else if let ``+SET+ +{+value~b~ +&&&+ value~m~+}+`` be ``setValue``:
 .. Let ``value~b_cast~`` be xref:cast_op[``value~b~`` casted to type ``typeIR``].
 .. Let ``value~m_cast~`` be xref:cast_op[``value~m~`` casted to type ``typeIR``].
 .. Return ``+SET+ +{+value~b_cast~ +&&&+ value~m_cast~+}+``.
. Else if let ``+SET+ +{+value~l~ +..+ value~u~+}+`` be ``setValue``:
 .. Let ``value~l_cast~`` be xref:cast_op[``value~l~`` casted to type ``typeIR``].
 .. Let ``value~u_cast~`` be xref:cast_op[``value~u~`` casted to type ``typeIR``].
 .. Return ``+SET+ +{+value~l_cast~ +..+ value~u_cast~+}+``.

<<bitacc_range_op,``value`` ``+[+`` ``value'`` ``+:+`` ``value''`` ``+]+``>>

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~b~`` be ``value``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~h~`` be ``value'``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~l~`` be ``value''``.

. Let ``i~b~`` be xref:int_of_integerValue[the integer representation of  ``integerValue~b~``].
. Let ``i~h~`` be xref:int_of_integerValue[the integer representation of  ``integerValue~h~``].
. Let ``i~l~`` be xref:int_of_integerValue[the integer representation of  ``integerValue~l~``].
. Let ``int`` be ``i~h~`` + ``1`` - ``i~l~``.
. Let!~type~ ``w`` be ``int``.

. Let ``i`` be xref:bitacc[the bitslice of ``i~b~`` from ``i~h~`` to ``i~l~``].
. Return ``w +W+ i``.

<<bitacc_offset_op,``value`` ``+[+`` %1 + : %2 ``+]+``>>

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~b~`` be ``value``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~l~`` be ``value'``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~w~`` be ``value''``.

. Let ``i~b~`` be xref:int_of_integerValue[the integer representation of  ``integerValue~b~``].
. Let ``i~l~`` be xref:int_of_integerValue[the integer representation of  ``integerValue~l~``].
. Let ``w`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:nat_of_integerValue[the natural number representation of  ``integerValue~w~``].
. Let ``i~h~`` be ``i~l~`` + ``w`` - ``1``.
. Let ``i`` be xref:bitacc[the bitslice of ``i~b~`` from ``i~h~`` to ``i~l~``].
. Return ``w +W+ i``.

<<bitacc_range_replace_op,``value`` ``+[+`` ``value'`` ``+:+`` ``value''`` ``+]+`` replaced with ``value'''``>>

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~b~`` be ``value``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~h~`` be ``value'``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~l~`` be ``value''``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~r~`` be ``value'''``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral`` be ``integerValue~b~``.

. Let!~type~ ``w +W+ i~b~`` be ``integerLiteral``.

. Let ``i~h~`` be xref:int_of_integerValue[the integer representation of  ``integerValue~h~``].
. Let ``i~l~`` be xref:int_of_integerValue[the integer representation of  ``integerValue~l~``].
. Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral'`` be ``integerValue~r~``.

. Let!~type~ ``++_++ +W+ i~r~`` be ``integerLiteral'``.

. Let ``i`` be xref:bitacc_replace[the bitslice of ``i~b~`` from ``i~h~`` to ``i~l~`` replaced with ``i~r~``].
. Return ``w +W+ i``.

<<bitacc_offset_replace_op,``value`` ``+[+`` %1 + : %2 ``+]+`` replaced with ``value'''``>>

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~b~`` be ``value``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~l~`` be ``value'``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~w~`` be ``value''``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~r~`` be ``value'''``.

. Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral`` be ``integerValue~b~``.

. Let!~type~ ``w +W+ i~b~`` be ``integerLiteral``.

. Let ``i~l~`` be xref:int_of_integerValue[the integer representation of  ``integerValue~l~``].
. Let ``n~w~`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:nat_of_integerValue[the natural number representation of  ``integerValue~w~``].
. Let ``i~h~`` be ``i~l~`` + ``n~w~`` - ``1``.
. Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral'`` be ``integerValue~r~``.

. Let!~type~ ``++_++ +W+ i~r~`` be ``integerLiteral'``.

. Let ``i`` be xref:bitacc_replace[the bitslice of ``i~b~`` from ``i~h~`` to ``i~l~`` replaced with ``i~r~``].
. Return ``w +W+ i``.

