. Else if let ``+STRUCT+ ++_++ +<+++_++^{asterisk}^+>+ +{+( ++_++ typeIR ++_++ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return xref:sum_nat[sum``+(+`` ``$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^`` ``+)+``].
. Else if let ``+HEADER+ ++_++ +<+++_++^{asterisk}^+>+ +{+( ++_++ typeIR ++_++ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
