. Let ``typeFrame^{asterisk}^`` be ``TC.+LOCAL+.+FRAMES+``.
. Let!~type~ ``typeFrame~h~ {two-colons} typeFrame~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``typeFrame^{asterisk}^``.

