 .. Else if ``p'`` matches pattern ``+BLOCK+``:
  ... Let ``typeFrame`` be ``TC.+BLOCK+.+FRAME+``.
  ... Let ``varTypeIR'^?^`` be xref:find_map[the value of ``id`` in map ``typeFrame``].
  ... Try:
   .... {empty}
    ..... Let!~type~ ``varTypeIR`` be ``varTypeIR'^?^``.

    ..... Return ``varTypeIR``.
   .... {empty}
    ..... Check that ``·`` is equal to xref:find_map[the value of ``id`` in map ``typeFrame``].

    ..... Return xref:find_var_t[the type of variable ``id`` from the ``+GLOBAL+`` layer of ``TC``].
 .. Else:
  ... Let ``typeFrame^{asterisk}^`` be ``TC.+LOCAL+.+FRAMES+``.
  ... Let ``varTypeIR'^?^`` be xref:find_maps[the value of ``id`` in maps ``typeFrame^{asterisk}^``].
  ... Try:
   .... {empty}
