  ... Let ``callTargetKey`` be xref:callTargetKey[the call target key for ``nameIR`` ``+(+`` ``argumentIR^{asterisk}^`` ``+)+``].
  ... Return xref:find_overloaded[finding the item in ``callableTypeDefEnv`` matching ``callTargetKey`` using parameter getter ``$parameterListIR_of_callableTypeDefIR``].
. Else if ``cursor`` matches pattern ``+BLOCK+``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``nameIR`` be ``prefixedNameIR``.

