 .. Let ``callTargetKey`` be xref:callTargetKey[the call target key for ``nameIR`` ``+(+`` ``argumentIR^{asterisk}^`` ``+)+``].
 .. Let ``callResolution<callableTypeDefIR>^?^`` be xref:find_overloaded[finding the item in ``callableTypeDefEnv`` matching ``callTargetKey`` using parameter getter ``$parameterListIR_of_callableTypeDefIR``].
 .. Try:
  ... {empty}
   .... Let!~type~ ``callableId +:+ callableTypeDefIR +#+ id~default~^{asterisk}^ +#+ id~optional~^{asterisk}^`` be ``callResolution<callableTypeDefIR>^?^``.

