   .... Try:
    ..... {empty}
     ...... Let!~type~ ``( callableId, callableTypeDefIR )`` be ``(callableId, callableTypeDefIR)^?^``.

     ...... Return ( ``callableId``, ``callableTypeDefIR`` ).
    ..... {empty}
     ...... Check that ``·`` is equal to ``xref:find_non_overloaded[$find_non_overloaded<callableTypeDefIR>(TC.+BLOCK+.+CALLABLE+, nameIR)]``.

     ...... Return xref:find_callableDef_non_overloaded_t[the non-overloaded callable definition of ``nameIR`` from the ``+GLOBAL+`` layer of ``TC``].
  ... Else:
   .... Let!~type~ ``nameIR`` be ``prefixedNameIR``.

