xref:find_local_return_type_t[The expected return type in ``TC``]

. Let ``localKind`` be ``TC.+LOCAL+.+KIND+``.
. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If let ``+FUNCTION+ +:+ typeIR~ret~`` be ``localKind``:
   .... Return ``typeIR~ret~``.
  ... Else:
   .... Return ``typeIR~ret~``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``+ACTION+`` is equal to ``TC.+LOCAL+.+KIND+``.

  ... Return ``+VOID+``.
. Let ``localKind`` be ``TC.+LOCAL+.+KIND+``.
. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``externMethodLocalKind`` be ``localKind``.

  ... If let ``+EXTERN_METHOD+ +:+ typeIR~ret~`` be ``externMethodLocalKind``:
   .... Return ``typeIR~ret~``.
  ... Else:
   .... Return ``typeIR~ret~``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``+CONTROL_APPLY_METHOD+`` is equal to ``TC.+LOCAL+.+KIND+``.

