      ....... Result in table entry state ``TBLS`` and ``+(++_++)+``.
     ...... {empty}
      ....... Check that ``TBLC.+MODE+`` is equal to ``+NONE+`` or ``TBLC.+MODE+`` is equal to ``+PRI+``.

      ....... Let ``TBLS`` be ``+NON_LPM+``.
      ....... Result in table entry state ``TBLS`` and ``+(++_++)+``.
