. Return ``IC`` with ``+GLOBAL+.+CONSTRUCTOR+`` set to ``constructorDefEnv``.

xref:add_constructorDefs_i[Where each of ``callableId^{asterisk}^`` to each of ``constructorDef^{asterisk}^`` are added to ``IC``]

. If ``callableId^{asterisk}^`` matches pattern ``[]``:
