    ..... Let ``value`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:assoc_[the value associated to ``nameIR`` in ``( id~member~, value~member~ )^{asterisk}^``].
    ..... Result in store ``STO'`` and ``typeId +.+ nameIR +.+ value``.
  ... {empty}
   .... Let!~type~ ``typedExpressionIR~base~`` be ``memberAccessBaseIR``.

   .... Let ``typeIR~base~`` be xref:type_of_typedExpressionIR[the type of ``typedExpressionIR~base~``].
   .... Let ``typeIR`` be xref:unroll_typeIR[``typeIR~base~`` with typedefs unrolled].
   .... Let!~type~ ``++_++ +[+n~size~+]+`` be ``typeIR``.

   .... Check that ``nameIR`` is equal to ``"size"``.

   .... Result in store ``STO'`` and ``+D+ n~size~``.
   .... Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``value'`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~base~``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p``].
   .... If let ``structValue`` be ``value'``:
    ..... Let ``+STRUCT+ ++_++ +{+( value~field~ id~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``structValue``.
    ..... Let ``value`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:assoc_[the value associated to ``nameIR`` in ``( id~field~, value~field~ )^{asterisk}^``].
    ..... Result in store ``STO~1~`` and ``value``.
   .... Else if let ``headerValue`` be ``value'``:
    ..... Let ``+HEADER+ ++_++ +{+++_++ +;+ ( value~field~ id~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``headerValue``.
    ..... Let ``value`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:assoc_[the value associated to ``nameIR`` in ``( id~field~, value~field~ )^{asterisk}^``].
    ..... Result in store ``STO~1~`` and ``value``.
   .... Else if let ``headerUnionValue`` be ``value'``:
    ..... Let ``+HEADER_UNION+ ++_++ +{+( value~field~ id~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``headerUnionValue``.
    ..... Let ``value`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:assoc_[the value associated to ``nameIR`` in ``( id~field~, value~field~ )^{asterisk}^``].
    ..... Result in store ``STO~1~`` and ``value``.
. Else if let ``typedExpressionIR~base~ +[+typedExpressionIR~index~+]+`` be ``expressionIR``:
 .. Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``value~base~`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~base~``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p``].
 .. Let store ``STO~2~`` and ``value'`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~index~``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO~1~`` at ``p``].
 .. Let!~type~ ``integerValue~index~`` be ``value'``.

 .. If let ``+TUPLE+ +(+value~e~^{asterisk}^+)+`` be ``value~base~``:
  ... Let ``n~index~`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:nat_of_integerValue[the natural number representation of  ``integerValue~index~``].
  ... Check that ``n~index~`` is less than the length of ``value~e~^{asterisk}^``.

  ... Let ``value`` be ``value~e~^{asterisk}^[n~index~]``.
  ... Result in store ``STO~2~`` and ``value``.
 .. Else if let ``+HEADER_STACK+ +[+value~e~^{asterisk}^ +(+++_++ +;+ ++_+++)++]+`` be ``value~base~``:
  ... Let ``n~index~`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:nat_of_integerValue[the natural number representation of  ``integerValue~index~``].
