 .. Let!~type~ ``typedExpressionIR~base~ +[+typedExpressionIR~hi~ +:+ typedExpressionIR~lo~+]+`` be ``sliceAccessExpressionIR``.

 .. Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``value~base~`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~base~``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p``].
 .. Let store ``STO~2~`` and ``value~hi~`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~hi~``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO~1~`` at ``p``].
 .. Let store ``STO~3~`` and ``value~lo~`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~lo~``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO~2~`` at ``p``].
