. Else if let ``callExpressionIR`` be ``expressionIR``:
 .. If let ``prefixedNameIR +<+typeArgumentListIR+>+ +(+argumentListIR+)+`` be ``callExpressionIR``:
  ... Let constructor ``constructorDef`` ``+<+`` ``typeArgumentListIR~inst~`` ``+>+`` with defaults ``id~default~^{asterisk}^`` and optionals ``id~optional~^{asterisk}^`` be the result of xref:Constructor_inst[finding constructor for ``prefixedNameIR`` ``+<+`` ``typeArgumentListIR`` ``+>+`` ``+(+`` ``argumentListIR`` ``+)+`` under context ``IC`` at ``p``].
  ... Let store ``STO~1~`` and instantiated ``object`` be the result of xref:Constructor_call[instantiating ``constructorDef`` ``+<+`` ``typeArgumentListIR~inst~`` ``+>+`` ``+(+`` ``argumentListIR`` ``+)+`` with defaults ``id~default~^{asterisk}^`` and optionals ``id~optional~^{asterisk}^``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p``].
  ... Let ``STO~2~`` be xref:add_store[``STO~1~`` where ``IC.+PATH+`` to ``object`` is added].
  ... Let ``value~ref~`` be ``+REF+ IC.+PATH+``.
  ... Result in store ``STO~2~`` and ``value~ref~``.
 .. Else:
  ... If let ``typedExpressionIR~base~ +.+ nameIR`` be ``callableTargetIR``:
   .... Let ``++_++ +#+ +(+typeIR~base~ ++_+++)+`` be ``typedExpressionIR~base~``.
   .... Check that ``nameIR`` is in ``+[+ "minSizeInBits", "minSizeInBytes", "maxSizeInBits", "maxSizeInBytes" +]+``.

   .... Result in store ``STO'`` and ``xref:sizeof[$sizeof(typeIR~base~, nameIR)]``.
  ... Else if let ``+TYPE+ prefixedNameIR +.+ nameIR`` be ``callableTargetIR``:
