   .... Else:
    ..... Check that ( ``·``, ``·`` ) is equal to xref:typeParameterListIR_of_typeDefIR[the type parameters of ``typeDefIR~base~``].

    ..... Let ``typeIR~base~`` be xref:typeIR_of_typeDefIR[the underlying type of ``typeDefIR~base~``].
