   .... Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``value`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``callableTargetIR +<+++_+++>+ +(+++_+++)+`` annotated with ``++_++``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p``].
   .... Result in store ``STO~1~`` and ``value``.
. Else:
 .. Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``value`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p``].
 .. Result in store ``STO~1~`` and ``value``.

xref:Exprs_inst[Exprs_inst]:

* Compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR^{asterisk}^``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p``.

. If ``typedExpressionIR^{asterisk}^`` matches pattern ``[]``:
 .. Result in store ``STO'`` and ``·``.
. Else:
 .. Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``value~h~`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~h~``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p``].
 .. Let store ``STO~2~`` and ``value~t~^{asterisk}^`` be the result of xref:Exprs_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~t~^{asterisk}^``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO~1~`` at ``p``].
 .. Result in store ``STO~2~`` and ``value~h~ {two-colons} value~t~^{asterisk}^``.

xref:Argument_inst[Argument_inst]:

* Compile-time evaluation of ``argumentIR``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO~0~`` at ``p``.

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``typedExpressionIR`` be ``argumentIR``.

  ... Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``value`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO~0~`` at ``p``].
  ... Result in store ``STO~1~`` and ``value``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``nameIR +=+ typedExpressionIR`` be ``argumentIR``.

  ... Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``value`` be the result of xref:Expr_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO~0~`` at ``p``].
  ... Result in store ``STO~1~`` and ``value``.

xref:DirectApplicationStmt_inst[DirectApplicationStmt_inst]:

* Compile-time evaluation of ``constructorTargetIR +.+ +APPLY+ +(+argumentListIR+)+ +;+``, under context ``IC`` and store ``STO~0~`` at ``p``.

. Let ``prefixedNameIR +<+typeArgumentListIR+>+`` be ``constructorTargetIR``.
. Let constructor ``constructorDef`` ``+<+`` ``typeArgumentListIR~inst~`` ``+>+`` with defaults ``id~default~^{asterisk}^`` and optionals ``id~optional~^{asterisk}^`` be the result of xref:Constructor_inst[finding constructor for ``prefixedNameIR`` ``+<+`` ``typeArgumentListIR`` ``+>+`` ``+(+`` ``·`` ``+)+`` under context ``IC`` at ``p``].
. Let ``typeId`` be xref:flatten_prefixedNameIR[the string form of  ``prefixedNameIR``].
. Let ``IC~callee~`` be xref:enter_path_i[``IC`` with ``typeId`` added to the path].
. Let store ``STO~1~`` and instantiated ``object`` be the result of xref:Constructor_call[instantiating ``constructorDef`` ``+<+`` ``typeArgumentListIR~inst~`` ``+>+`` ``+(+`` ``·`` ``+)+`` with defaults ``id~default~^{asterisk}^`` and optionals ``id~optional~^{asterisk}^``, under context ``IC~callee~`` and store ``STO~0~`` at ``p``].
. Let ``typeId~fresh~`` be xref:fresh_typeId[a fresh type variable].
. Let ``typeIR`` be ``typeId``.
. Let ``nameIR`` be <<concat_text,the concatenation of ``+[+ typeId, "_", typeId~fresh~ +]+``>>.
. Let ``objectId`` be ``IC.+PATH+`` concatenated with ``typeId``.
. Let ``STO~2~`` be xref:add_store[``STO~1~`` where ``objectId`` to ``object`` is added].
. Let ``constantDeclarationIR`` be ``+CONST+ typeIR nameIR +=+ +REF+ objectId +;+``.
. Let ``typedExpressionIR~base~`` be xref:typedExpressionIR[``nameIR`` annotated with a pair of type ``typeIR`` and compile-time known-ness ``+CTK+``].
. Let ``callableTargetIR`` be ``typedExpressionIR~base~ +.+ "apply"``.
. Let ``callStatementIR`` be ``callableTargetIR +<+typeArgumentListIR~inst~+>+ +(+argumentListIR+)+ +;+``.
. Result in store ``STO~2~`` and desugared ``constantDeclarationIR``, ``callStatementIR``.

xref:Stmt_inst[Stmt_inst]:

* Compile-time evaluation of ``statementIR''``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p'``.

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If let ``emptyStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO'``, and ``emptyStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``assignmentStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO'``, and ``assignmentStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``callStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO'``, and ``callStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``directApplicationStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Let store ``STO~1~`` and desugared ``constantDeclarationIR``, ``callStatementIR`` be the result of xref:DirectApplicationStmt_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``directApplicationStatementIR``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p'``].
   .... Let ``blockStatementIR`` be ``+{++[+ constantDeclarationIR, callStatementIR +]++}+``.
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``blockStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``exitStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO'``, and ``exitStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``conditionalStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... If let ``+IF+ +(+typedExpressionIR~cond~+)+ statementIR~then~`` be ``conditionalStatementIR``:
    ..... Let context ``IC~then~``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``statementIR~then_inst~`` be the result of xref:Stmt_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``statementIR~then~``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p'``].
    ..... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``+IF+ +(+typedExpressionIR~cond~+)+ statementIR~then_inst~``.
   .... Else:
    ..... Let context ``IC~then~``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``statementIR~then_inst~`` be the result of xref:Stmt_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``statementIR~then~``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p'``].
    ..... Let context ``IC~else~``, store ``STO~2~``, and ``statementIR~else_inst~`` be the result of xref:Stmt_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``statementIR~else~``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO~1~`` at ``p'``].
    ..... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO~2~``, and ``+IF+ +(+typedExpressionIR~cond~+)+ statementIR~then_inst~ +ELSE+ statementIR~else_inst~``.
  ... Else if let ``forStatementIR'`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... If let ``annotationList +FOR+ +(+forInitStatementListIR +;+ typedExpressionIR +;+ forUpdateStatementListIR+)+ statementIR`` be ``forStatementIR'``:
    ..... Let context ``IC~body~``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``statementIR~body~`` be the result of xref:Stmt_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``statementIR``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p'``].
    ..... Let ``forStatementIR`` be ``annotationList +FOR+ +(+forInitStatementListIR +;+ typedExpressionIR +;+ forUpdateStatementListIR+)+ statementIR~body~``.
    ..... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``forStatementIR``.
   .... Else if let ``annotationList +FOR+ +(+typeIR nameIR +IN+ forCollectionExpressionIR+)+ statementIR`` be ``forStatementIR'``:
    ..... Let context ``IC~body~``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``statementIR~body~`` be the result of xref:Stmt_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``statementIR``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p'``].
    ..... Let ``forStatementIR`` be ``annotationList +FOR+ +(+typeIR nameIR +IN+ forCollectionExpressionIR+)+ statementIR~body~``.
    ..... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``forStatementIR``.
   .... Else:
    ..... Check that ``annotationList`` is equal to ``annotationList'``.

    ..... Let context ``IC~body~``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``statementIR~body~`` be the result of xref:Stmt_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``statementIR``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p'``].
    ..... Let ``forStatementIR`` be ``annotationList +FOR+ +(+annotationList typeIR nameIR +IN+ forCollectionExpressionIR+)+ statementIR~body~``.
    ..... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``forStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``breakStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO'``, and ``breakStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``continueStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO'``, and ``continueStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``+SWITCH+ +(+typedExpressionIR+)+ +{+switchCaseListIR+}+`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Let store ``STO~1~`` and ``switchCaseListIR~inst~`` be the result of xref:SwitchCases_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``switchCaseListIR``, under context ``IC'`` and store ``STO'`` at ``p'``].
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``+SWITCH+ +(+typedExpressionIR+)+ +{+switchCaseListIR~inst~+}+``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``p'`` matches pattern ``+LOCAL+``.

  ... If let ``returnStatementIR`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Result in context ``IC'``, store ``STO'``, and ``returnStatementIR``.
  ... Else if let ``annotationList +{+blockElementStatementListIR+}+`` be ``statementIR''``:
   .... Let ``IC~1~`` be xref:enter_i[``IC'`` with a new local frame].
   .... Let context ``IC~2~``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``++_++ +{+blockElementStatementListIR~inst~+}+`` be the result of xref:Block_inst[compile-time evaluation of ``annotationList +{+blockElementStatementListIR+}+``, under context ``IC~1~``, and store ``STO'``].
   .... Let ``IC~3~`` be xref:exit_i[``IC~2~`` with the innermost frame removed].
   .... Result in context ``IC~3~``, store ``STO~1~``, and ``annotationList +{+blockElementStatementListIR~inst~+}+``.

xref:BlockElementStmt_inst[BlockElementStmt_inst]:

* Compile-time evaluation of ``blockElementStatementIR``, under context ``IC~0'~``, and store ``STO~0'~``.

. If let ``constantDeclarationIR`` be ``blockElementStatementIR``:
 .. Let context ``IC~1~`` be the result of xref:ConstDecl_inst[loading ``constantDeclarationIR``, under context ``IC~0'~`` at ``+LOCAL+``].
 .. Result in context ``IC~1~``, store ``STO~0'~``, and ``constantDeclarationIR``.
. Else if let ``variableDeclarationIR`` be ``blockElementStatementIR``:
 .. Result in context ``IC~0'~``, store ``STO~0'~``, and ``variableDeclarationIR``.
