 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``·`` is equal to ``xref:name_annotation[$name_annotation(annotationList~actionDef~)]``.

  ... Let ``controlPlaneNameIR`` be xref:ite[``nameIR`` if ``cursor`` is equal to ``+GLOBAL+`` otherwise the result of joining ``IC.+PATH+`` concatenated with ``nameIR`` with separator ``"."``].
  ... Let ``tableActionReferenceIR'`` be ``prefixedNameIR controlPlaneNameIR +(+argumentListIR+)+``.
