. Let ``tablePropertyIR'''^{asterisk}^`` be xref:filter_[``tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``( tablePropertyIR has type tableCustomPropertyIR )^{asterisk}^``].
. Let!~type~ ``tableCustomPropertyIR^{asterisk}^`` be ``tablePropertyIR'''^{asterisk}^``.

. Let ``TBL`` be +{++KEYS+ ``tableKeysPropertyIR``, +ACTIONS+ ``tableActionsPropertyIR``, +DEFAULT_ACTION+ ``tableDefaultActionPropertyIR``, +ENTRIES+ ``tableEntriesPropertyIR``, +CUSTOMS+ ``tableCustomPropertyIR^{asterisk}^``+}+.
. Return ``TBL``.

xref:init_tableKeys[$init_tableKeys(tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^)]

. Let ``tablePropertyIR'^{asterisk}^`` be xref:filter_[``tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``( tablePropertyIR has type tableKeysPropertyIR )^{asterisk}^``].
. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``tableKeysPropertyIR'^{asterisk}^`` be ``tablePropertyIR'^{asterisk}^``.

  ... Let!~type~ ``tableKeysPropertyIR`` be ``tableKeysPropertyIR'^{asterisk}^``.

  ... Return ``tableKeysPropertyIR``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``·`` is equal to xref:filter_[``tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``( tablePropertyIR has type tableKeysPropertyIR )^{asterisk}^``].

  ... Return ``+KEY+ +=+ +{+·+}+``.

xref:init_tableEntries[$init_tableEntries(tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^)]

. Let ``tablePropertyIR'^{asterisk}^`` be xref:filter_[``tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``( tablePropertyIR has type tableEntriesPropertyIR )^{asterisk}^``].
