  ... Return ``tableEntriesPropertyIR``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``·`` is equal to xref:filter_[``tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``( tablePropertyIR has type tableEntriesPropertyIR )^{asterisk}^``].

  ... Return ``· +ENTRIES+ +=+ +{+·+}+``.
